  "scope": "Adds fixed-reference arithmetic differences with complete native scans. Adds initialized sum/subtraction/equality operands, fallback X vectors and configured widths; other arithmetic-base families refuse before output. Adds fixed-reference gate splices with complete native scans and queued/executing wrapper frames. Adds exact AND/OR/XOR and BUF/NOT native caches, inversion and pending/event associations; other subclasses of their cache bases refuse inventory. Adds immutable-reference mux cache splices and full queued/executing wrapper rows on every frame. Adds all allocated MUXZ cache/select/run/pending fields and typed queued/executing wrapper bindings; other logic families remain separate. Includes per-signal fixed-reference splices with complete native scans. Includes initialized static signal storage, assignment masks/links and flags; other signal subclasses refuse observation. Includes full-scan lossless per-filter wire splice differences against a fixed reference; no dirty-state shortcuts. Includes full-scan fixed-reference graph deltas, including newly allocated nodes. Includes net allocation, binding and tagged-port observations with restored faults; payload contents remain separate. Includes static four-state array storage, ranges, existing word-handle cache links and independently registered read-port state. Automatic/aliased/other-family storage and array callbacks fail closed. Word/address/link/cache faults restore without invoking propagation setters. Requires native controls and board integration; destination net/fanout contents and general rollback remain open."
}
